    "The system prompt also includes the household taste profile summary and dislikes.",
    "The system prompt includes the top-rated and low-rated recipe titles and the pantry's \"use soon\" items and region and current month for seasonality and units and servings and recently cooked titles to avoid repeats and nutrition guidance: balanced plates and vegetables in every meal."
